### The Taylor-Green vortex: a coupled system with three field
### components over three variables.
###
###   u_t + u u_x + v u_y + p_x - nu (u_xx + u_yy) = 0
###   v_t + u v_x + v v_y + p_y - nu (v_xx + v_yy) = 0
###   u_x + v_y                                    = 0
###
### with the exact solution
###   u = -cos(x) sin(y) e^(-2 nu t)
###   v =  sin(x) cos(y) e^(-2 nu t)
###   p = -(cos 2x + cos 2y) e^(-4 nu t) / 4
###
### The momentum equations carry u u_x + v u_y: one field component
### multiplying the derivative of another.  The scalar Residual block
### cannot write that, which is why the System block exists.
Init_w       Glorot_norm
Rand_seed    20260810 /
Restart      0 /
Output_deriv 0 /

Nlayer       4 /
3 / (x, y, t)
40 /
40 /
3 / (u, v, p)

Loss_term  DATA         400  data.dat    1.d0  /
Loss_term  COLLOCATION  800  colloc.dat  1.d-2 /

### The momentum equations carry only p_x and p_y, so the residual fixes
### the pressure only up to an additive constant.  The gauge is fixed by
### the DATA term, which supplies p at 400 points.  A residual holding p
### itself would not be a gauge condition but a further equation, and the
### exact solution does not satisfy it: its pressure has rms 0.22 on the
### collocation set, not zero.
Sys_wcomp  4.63877 4.28298 13.58628 /   1/||y_i||^2, measured from the data

System 3 14 /
TRM  1  1   0 0 1   1.d0  /   u_t
XUX  1  1 1 1 0 0   1.d0  /   u * u_x
XUX  1  2 1 0 1 0   1.d0  /   v * u_y
TRM  1  3   1 0 0   1.d0  /   p_x
TRM  1  1   2 0 0  -0.1d0 /   -nu u_xx
TRM  1  1   0 2 0  -0.1d0 /   -nu u_yy
TRM  2  2   0 0 1   1.d0  /   v_t
XUX  2  1 2 1 0 0   1.d0  /   u * v_x
XUX  2  2 2 0 1 0   1.d0  /   v * v_y
TRM  2  3   0 1 0   1.d0  /   p_y
TRM  2  2   2 0 0  -0.1d0 /   -nu v_xx
TRM  2  2   0 2 0  -0.1d0 /   -nu v_yy
TRM  3  1   1 0 0   1.d0  /   u_x
TRM  3  2   0 1 0   1.d0  /   v_y

Exact_solution 1 /   colloc.dat carries u*, v*, p* in its last three columns

Hod_K      2 /
1.d0
0.d0
0.d0
Hod_dense  1 /

Hod_check  0 /
Num_validation 60 /
Validation_cyc 500 /
P_max          2000 /
Epoch      20000 /
Activation TANH /
Conv       1.d-14 /
Num_batch  40 /
Checkpoint_cyc 100000 /
GD_method  Adam
GD_param   0.002d0 0.9d0 0.999d0 1.d-8 0.d0 /
